<title>CHINA: China plans bank devoted to housing loans.</title>
<headline>China plans bank devoted to housing loans.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1996-04-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>China is planning to set up a bank devoted to housing loans in Shanghai, the Shanghai Securities News on Friday quoted Minister of Construction Hou Jie as saying.</p>
<p>Beijing plans to set up a department devoted to housing deposits and gradually turn it into an independent bank, Hou was quoted as saying.</p>
<p>The newspaper gave no further details and officials at the Construction Ministry declined to comment.</p>
</text>
